ice daily, with food. Experience best results after 6 weeks of daily use."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Caution keep out of the reach of children."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"If you are pregnant or nursing, please consult with your healthcare professional before taking BeActive Collagen shield.\r\n"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Daily support for healthy\r\nCollagen, & muscles\r\nSynovial fluid & cartilage\r\nLigaments, & tendons\r\nInflammation response\r\nCollagen support from the sea...\r\nProtects stomach\r\n20 clinical studies\r\nEco-friendly, Non-GMO\r\nFlash-frozen for maximum bioactivity"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Eco-friendly, Non-GMO"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Protects collagen\r\nSupports joints\r\nReduces pain\r\nOccasional pain due to exercise or overuse."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Beactive Collagen Shield 500 mg"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No artificial colors, or fillers\r\nNo gluten, soy, yeast, wheat, or dairy"},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Contains shellfish"},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Important Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not use if seal is broken.\r\n"},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Keep out of direct sunlight."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Manufactured in USA"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Copyright 2021 Innovative Health Laboratories, LLC."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2024-08-22","typ